cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this package, please cite both the paper and this archive."
title: "Labor backing accounts: replication package"
abstract: >-
  Code, measured artifacts and documentation behind "Labor-Backed Finance and the Fiscal
  Exposure to AI". Labor backing accounts decompose United States financial claims by the
  income that services each claim and by who holds, guarantees or owes it, and the package
  rebuilds every number the paper reports.
